bles. The Grab &amp; Go bar offers quiet snacks, and curated wines and drinks to enjoy throughout the film.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 row d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mb-5 mb-lg-3 d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm-start\">\n                    <h6 class=\"fjalla-one-regular text-dark text-uppercase mb-4\">Discover</h6>\n                    <ul class=\"nav flex-column\">\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/select-your-cinema\" class=\"p-0\">Locations</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/ecards\" class=\"p-0\">Gift Cards</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/whats-on/events\" class=\"p-0\">Events</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/private-hire\" class=\"p-0\">Private Hire</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/membership\" class=\"p-0\">Membership</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/account\" class=\"p-0\">Sign In</a></p></li>\n                                            </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mb-5 mb-lg-3 d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm-start\">\n                    <h6 class=\"fjalla-one-regular text-dark text-uppercase mb-4\">About</h6>\n                    <ul class=\"nav flex-column\">\n                                                <li class=\"\">