_4_stack\" class=\"bg-dark py-4 py-lg-5 m-0\"><div class=\"container d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1\"><div class=\"row gx-2 gx-md-4 gy-2 gy-md-4 flex-grow-1\"><div class=\"col-12 d-flex flex-column text-white\"><!-- widget: hero_main --><div class=\"hero-main-widget hm1 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1 justify-content-center\" style=\"position:relative\"><div class=\"row justify-content-center\" style=\"position:relative;z-index:1\"><div class=\"col-lg-10 mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\"fjalla-one-regular majortitle fs-4 hm-h text-uppercase p-0 m-0 pb-2\">UNRIVALLED CINEMA</h2><div class=\" pb-2\">Cinema as it’s meant to be - immersive, effortless, and unforgettable. Our screens offer a truly unrivalled experience with state-of-the-art sound and vision. Settle into spacious, reclining seats with ample legroom and personal tables. The Grab & Go bar offers quiet snacks, and curated wines and drinks to enjoy throughout the film.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"container-fluid bg-light mt-auto\">\n    <div class=\"p-1 pt-4 p-lg-5 border-top row\">\n\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 mb-5 mb-lg-3\">\n            <h6 class=\"fjalla-one-regular text-dark mb-4 text-uppercase lh-sm\">A hub of entertainment, with cinema at its heart, set in iconic locations</h6>\n            <div class=\"flex-column text-body-secondary\">\n                <p>Cinema as it&#039;s meant to be - immersive, effortless, and unforgettable. With state-of-the-art sound and vision, our screens offer a truly unrivalled experience. Settle into spacious, reclining seats with ample legroom and personal tables. The Grab &amp; Go bar offers quiet snacks, and curated wines and drinks to enjoy throughout the film.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 row d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mb-5 mb-lg-3 d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n      